# Vercel / production

- Avoid request/response payload designs near platform body limits; uploads go direct to Supabase Storage.
- Server routes return small JSON payloads.
- Use Node runtime for SDKs requiring Node APIs.
- Validate production env at deploy/start boundaries without exposing values.
- Preview deployments must not point to production destructive resources unless explicitly designed.
- Production release requires full gate and rollback notes.
